          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Wave_GJmr-9058.jpg",
            "subheading": "2021",
            "heading": "<strong>The first boards go out - and the reviews start coming in.</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Wave Watersports launches off the back of Wave Spas, built on the same conviction: the things putting people off getting on the water - storage, roof racks, big up-front cost - were the wrong problem to be solving. The first customer reviews land in the spring.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
