        },
        "content-3": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/PHOTO-2023-07-28-11-52-28_1_c347105e-4353-4f87-9f34-f24699121c43.jpg",
            "subheading": "2024",
            "heading": "<strong>The 2.0 generation arrives.</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>The core boards are refreshed as a new generation - Cruiser 2.0, Woody 2.0, Tourer 2.0 and the Pro - tuned for stability first, so beginners feel steady from the very first paddle.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle",
            "highlighted_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "content-4": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Product_Hero_2_d4c58736-9524-4709-bd42-ded0f111bda1.png",
            "subheading": "2024",
            "heading": "<strong>Four thousand reviews, and counting.</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Wave Watersports passes 4,000 customer reviews at a 4.6-star average, with more than eight in ten customers leaving five stars. The customers, as ever, get the last word.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle",
            "highlighted_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "content-5": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SUP_3.0_launch.png",
            "subheading": "2025",
            "heading": "<strong>The all-new Wave 3.0 range arrives.</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Our biggest step forward yet. The 3.0 range rebuilds the board from the ground up — stiffer drop-stitch construction for a rigid, hard-board feel that still packs into a bag, refined shapes for better glide and tracking, and upgraded kit throughout. The same easy-in, easy-out promise, made noticeably better on the water.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
